        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Trump Entertainment Resorts, Icahn Enterprises, Landry's, Golden Nugget Atlantic City\n- Places: New York City, New York, General Motors Building\n\nFacts:\n- In February 2011, Landry's purchased Golden Nugget Atlantic City from Trump Entertainment Resorts, and the sale was approved in late May 2011.\n- Since 2016, Trump Entertainment Resorts has been a subsidiary of Icahn Enterprises.\n- Icahn Enterprises L.P. is an American conglomerate company headquartered at the General Motors Building in New York City, New York.",
